---
import SlideFolio from '@components/deck/SlideFolio.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide" id="s03-approach" data-slot="approach">
  <SlideFolio number={3} label="Our approach" />
  <div class="deck-inner">
    <p class="deck-eyebrow reveal-item">Codified Systems for Repeatable Judgement</p>
    <p class="deck-title mt-6 reveal-item" style="--delay: 90ms">
      The ability to anticipate performance at the earliest stages <em>looks like intuition and luck</em>, but it's forged from creating a <span class="gradient-text">well-sharpened, experience and information rich theory</span> on market evolution and company building.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
